      "body": "Selecting the visual-thread now causes useResume to call thread/session. The fixture has no mapping for that read and returns fixture_readonly, leaving resumedThread empty and the selected conversation composer permanently disabled. Its thread/resume response is an obsolete substitute: the application intentionally will not auto-resume a stored thread. The fixture also omits collaborationMode/list, which is read on active initial load and produces a persistent catalog-error notice. Thus this fixture cannot exercise the current selected-thread composer workflow as intended.",
